<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14215" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπο-φθῐνύθω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῠ</span>], poet. Verb, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>perish,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποφθινύθουσι δὲ λαοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.643
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				243
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.683
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> causal,
				<i>make to perish,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυμὸν ἀποφθινύθουσι</span>
			<i>lose</i> their life, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				16.540
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>diminish,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ μὲν αὔξεις τὰ δ᾽ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					916
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
